und\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states that riders charged for journeys ending at faulted docks receive refunds, which is the same as getting the journey refunded.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim_id\": \"B-006\",\n      \"verdict\": \"MISSING\",\n      \"evidence\": \"\",\n      \"evidence_source\": \"merged.md\",\n      \"rationale\": \"The reference text states stations are taken out of service but uses passive voice without specifying who performs this action. It does not explicitly state the support desk does this.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":52728,"type":"result","duration_ms":62440,"uuid":"22e6596a-4ac5-423c-855d-49b8da107b07","ttft_stream_ms":858,"time_to_request_ms":97,"first_content_frame_ms":858,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
